                <note rend="inline" type="source">884.6461 Tsana Dam/17: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Egypt</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Winship</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Cairo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-11-07T10:00:00+02:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 7,
                                1927—10 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received November 7—7:54
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>8. Alleged contract of White Company for Tsana Dam has aroused great local
                    interest and numerous inquiries indicate anxiety.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Winship</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
